      <title>Elizabeth Holmes Documentary Scores Major Debut With $15 Million</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-18/-you-can-see-everything-scores-major-debut-with-15-million</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d839dd2ab3d3586774b8054e</guid>
